      <Parameter>
         <Name>Shutterless Stokes I and V Images</Name>
         <ParameterKey>HDU:0</ParameterKey>
         <Description>Three-dimensional Level 0 SOT-FG shutterless Stokes I and V image data stored in the FITS Primary HDU. The first two array dimensions represent spatial image coordinates, and the third dimension contains two image planes corresponding to Stokes I and Stokes V. The field of view is restricted in shutterless mode. Images are acquired in selected discrete NFI spectral-line passbands rather than across a continuous wavelength range; the selected line and wavelength offset are given by FITS keywords WAVE and WAVEOFF. The arrays have not undergone ground-based scientific calibration.</Description>
         <Wave>
            <WaveType>Electromagnetic</WaveType>
            <WaveQuantity>Intensity</WaveQuantity>
            <WavelengthRange>
               <Low>517.2</Low>
               <High>656.3</High>
               <Units>nm</Units>
            </WavelengthRange>
         </Wave>
      </Parameter>
